# The Keep is local-first by policy: no Gemini key needed for anything text
# based (Oracle, Forge, the Round Table, Sentinel, Mechanic, hall dialogue,
# portrait lore). All of that routes to Ollama on the box (127.0.0.1:11434 by
# default -- see OLLAMA_URL / KEEP_TALK_MODEL in ai.ts) and simply does not run
# without it.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is optional and touches exactly one feature: pixel-art
# portrait IMAGE generation in the Grand Gallery (Nano Banana / Imagen), which
# has no local equivalent in this stack. Leave it blank to run fully local --
# portraits still get their chronicle lore, just no image.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# FastMCP & OpenClaw Live Endpoints
FASTMCP_FUNNEL_URL=https://openclaw.tail20a090.ts.net
FASTMCP_INTERNAL_URL=http://100.108.130.82:8100/mcp
RECLAW_API_BASE=http://100.108.130.82:8000
OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_WS=ws://100.108.130.82:18789
